-- Cartoona plain-PostgreSQL baseline (V0.1.38) - reference data
--
-- The rows the Supabase migrations seed and the business functions depend on:
-- the creation price catalog, candy packages, characters, the referral program
-- singleton and the homepage CMS singletons. Values are copied verbatim from
-- the migrated Supabase schema. Generated ids and timestamps are left to their
-- defaults, so a fresh environment gets its own ids, exactly like a fresh run
-- of the Supabase migrations.
--
-- A production data copy REPLACES these tables wholesale (orders, purchases,
-- examples and coupon rules reference their ids); it never merges into them.
-- See docs/PLAIN_POSTGRES.md, "Data-copy mapping".

-- creation_pricing

-- candy_packages

-- characters

-- referral_program_settings

-- homepage_content

-- homepage_hero_layout
